  "description": "Born and raised on Australia’s Gold Coast, former professional surfer FISHER shot to stardom with his 2018 hit ‘Losing It’ and has enjoyed non-stop global success ever since. His high-energy tech-house and outrageous onstage antics have taken him around the world and back again, with highlights this year including Tomorrowland, Creamfields, Ultra Europe, Escapade, FVDED In The Park and his very own TRIIP Festival in Malta. He also returned to Ibiza for another massive residency at [UNVRS] this season, inviting special guests such as Loco Dice, KI/KI, Maceo Plex, Sally C and plenty more.",
